      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think the real solution needs to be that the VRchat devs embrace adult content and add in an age verification system in game\n\nThey already allow you to mark worlds and avatars as NSFW but they do nothing with that\n\nCurrently the devs take a very stupid and inconsistent stance on adult content, at times saying its not allowed at all then other times saying its allowed only in private worlds, but again they allow you to mark a world or avatar as having sexual content but still allow you to upload it publically\n\nMeta needs to just step in and make them take a stance, either be fully against adult content and maintain the teen rating or have the game bumped up to mature rating or even the rarely seen adults only",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
