      "reactions": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This sounds very related to the [access-to-private-worlds](https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/access-to-private-worlds) issue.\n\nAnd again, the same solution seems obvious. We need more levels of world privacy. For example we need a separation between \"unlisted worlds\" (current implementation, anyone with the link can make instances) and \"private worlds\" (only author can make instances).\n\nWhile on the subject of world privacy levels. A way to allow members of specific groups to create instances of a world would also be useful as a world privacy level.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
